                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I played this game back in 2013 on my Xbox 360 which I got free through Xbox Live Gold, getting to experience this game again was very nostalgic and reminded me when I played dishonored on the Xbox as well. Overall I still love this game, the voice acting really carries alongside the art. It's even crazier this was done by a one man army!!! If you wanna play a game where you get to combo into the sky and chuckle at some bits I recommend this game hard.",
